WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.168
♪ ("WHALES" BY
HAIL MARY MALLON PLAYS) ♪

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.037
-PATRICK: Hey! What's up?
-SPEAKER: Where're we going
 into?

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.406
We're going into
Civic Development Group.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.573
 And what we do,

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:11.477
is we call up people
and chisel 'em outta money.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.513
 ♪ Money on my
 Muthafuckin' mind ♪

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:16.282
Patrick and I both work
at this telemarketing place.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.719
I was just this 14-year-old
 kid making calls

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:21.187
 on behalf of charities.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:22.922
It's like a big-ass cookout.

00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:23.990
 ♪ Get money ♪

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:25.658
 ♪ Money out my
 Muthafuckin' mouth ♪

00:00:25.724 --> 00:00:28.561
SPEAKER 2: I didn't think I was
doing anything bad at all.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.997
Now, Lisa, these families,
they do need your support.

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:35.435
The business model is defrauding
the most vulnerable in this
country.

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:39.038
 -It was a big-time scam.
-This is capitalism.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:40.306
♪ Get money, money, money... ♪

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.509
SPEAKER: We need to show the
world what this place really
 does.

00:00:43.776 --> 00:00:46.912
The media and the government
haven't been able to stop them,

00:00:47.012 --> 00:00:48.648
 so now, it's up to us.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.452
PATRICK:

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:56.256
 ♪ Money on my
 Muthafuckin' mind ♪

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:59.191
SPEAKER: Pat and I had vowed
 to expose the industry.

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:00.260
And it seemed to be evolving

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:04.030
 into something bigger
 and weirder than ever.

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:05.464
Political action campaigns.

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:06.465
SPEAKER 4: Robocalls.

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:07.967
SPEAKER 5:
Federal Trade Commission.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.269
SPEAKER 6: Congress.

00:01:10.135 --> 00:01:12.572
This guy does not
wanna talk to us,

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:14.373
so we figured
we'd get something to eat.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:17.944
Oh! There he is. Leave the food.
Go! Go, go, go, go, go.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.144
 ♪ Get money ♪

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:23.215
SPEAKER 7:
Regulating telemarketing is like
regulating Somalian pirates.

00:01:23.248 --> 00:01:24.617
It just can't be done.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.622
You're like a whistleblower.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.424
SPEAKER 8:
They don't want us here, bro.

00:01:31.524 --> 00:01:33.225
SPEAKER 9: Dude!
 Let's just go, Sam.

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:35.261
SPEAKER 10:
 There's no turning back.

00:01:35.494 --> 00:01:37.630
♪ Money, money, money... ♪

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:44.871
They were calling,
and the initials were CASH.

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:50.109
So, they would tell you,
"Make the check out to C-A-S-H."

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:52.478
Wake up! Smell the coffee.

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:55.682
 ♪ Money on my
 Muthafuckin' mind ♪

